WEBVTT

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:20.670
Phastan

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:24.750
Adventurer's Guild

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:28.250
I swear it! The slime could breathe fire!

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:30.250
You want us to believe that?

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:33.420
I watched the other monster get engulfed in flames.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.670
Like it used magic or something...

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:37.880
In your dreams, Gale!

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:41.250
No slime could use magic like that.

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:44.750
Bet you just dozed off before you put out your campfire.

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:48.830
Yeah, and I bet that monster stumbled right into it.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:49.880
Mystery solved!

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:54.330
Laugh all you want!

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:08.500
Oh, Yuji. Giving up on your request?

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:13.920
Everyone has to sometimes. Don't fret too much over it.

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.040
I'm not here to give up.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:27.420
One thing led to another and I wound up finishing early.

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.330
B-b-but how did you get so much?!

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:31.330
Are these real?!

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:34.380
I have to report this to the branch chief!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.130
What in the...?

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.330
You ever seen that many Drya flowers?

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:40.830
The guy's just a tamer, right?

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.330
You again, huh Yuji?

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:47.920
Aegis...

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.670
This is enough for two whole years.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.080
You're no run of the mill tamer, are you?

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:55.830
I'd rather not make an ordeal out of this...

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:57.420
Did I bring in too much?

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:00.460
No, I'll buy the whole load off you.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:04.210
Not that we have much use for potions around here.

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:09.710
No? I found myself up against
a pretty tough monster out there.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.130
What?

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:12.880
Chief!

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:13.920
We have trouble!

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:16.960
What is it?

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.000
Smoke signals have gone up in the woods!

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:24.250
You guys copy?

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:25.830
Loud and clear!

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:27.920
Anyone have eyes on any monsters?

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:31.420
We have reports of monsters in the woods!

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.880
Lots of them! All headed somewhere.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.580
Any idea where?

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:40.210
What do you guys think?

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.920
No clue!

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.500
They're walking towards the sun.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:46.250
They're going the opposite way here.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.750
Should we follow 'em?

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.790
Hmm, they seem to be congregating somewhere.

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:53.790
Probably not good, huh?

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.670
That's ridiculous! Where could
ten thousand monsters be headed?!

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:05.080
Judging by their positioning...

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:08.380
Yup!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.210
They're headed for the town you're in!

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:18.580
Listen up, adventurers!

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:23.790
An army of ten thousand monsters
is descending upon us here in Phastan!

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:27.580
They'll be at our walls in less than an hour.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.880
I want all of you to flee town.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:35.170
We can't! What about all the people here?

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.130
You expect us all to just run and save ourselves?

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.790
You said it yourself, there are ten thousand monsters!

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:43.880
There's no way folks here would be safe!

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:47.080
We're staying put and protecting these people!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:52.500
If there was a safe way to protect the town,
I swear we'd do it.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.630
But we're far outnumbered!

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:58.790
The only option we have
is to keep as many of you alive as we can!

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.040
Is this really the only way...?

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:09.920
I have an idea.

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:11.380
Yuji...?

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.000
No need to play the hero, kid.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.670
You're just a tamer.

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.250
What the-?!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:21.960
Slimes have bones?

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.330
It's a dragon bone.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:28.880
A dragon...

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:32.290
Us tamers have a special little trick, see.

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:37.540
I can only do it once, but I can use this bone
to recreate a dragon's flame.

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:41.250
I'll use it to wipe them all out.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.630
Seriously?

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:45.290
You can do that?

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:52.000
Yuji, I'm well aware you're no ordinary tamer.

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:53.630
But even still...

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:57.250
I've never heard of anyone recreating dragon's breath.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.330
That slime...

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.580
Let him have a go, Aegis.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:21.380
What other choice do we have?

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:25.170
Now, how can we help?

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:33.880
Here. Take a Drya flower potion.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.210
Never imagined we'd need them so soon.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:47.000
Hurry! The first wave of monsters
will reach us any moment!

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.460
Keep them outside the gate!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.830
Bring every last weapon you've got!

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:53.040
Right!

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:01.630
Proud Wolf, what's the situation?

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:07.040
Well! I'm doin' my best to get
these little slimes back in one blob!

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.830
We're racing back!

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:11.000
Sure taking the scenic route, though.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:15.460
I mean, I ain't lookin' to fight, okay?

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:21.290
Thank ya kindly, Yuji! Feelin' pepped as ever!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:22.250
Lucky!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.250
What about us, Yuji?

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.170
You guys are just along for the ride.

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:27.460
Boo!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.330
Meanie!

00:07:58.170 --> 00:07:58.960
Take this!

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:25.210
Did we get 'em?

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:29.710
No...

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:36.210
We're only getting started!

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.880
Listen up, we're going to finish this in 15 minutes.

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:54.960
Magic Maker!

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:00.540
Tamer Skills

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:00.540
Bonus Element A

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:00.540
Support Magic

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:00.540
Holy Magic

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:01.790
Sage Skills

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.420
Magic Buffs

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:04.540
Earth Magic

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:04.540
Status

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:04.540
Range

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.250
Ice Magic

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:07.460
Area of Effect

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.250
 Fire Magic

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.250
Range

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.250
Yuji

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:12.750
We should have some leeway.

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:16.710
I need something that will keep the town safe
and be sure to hit everything out there...

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:19.130
Yuji, we have an emergency!

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:20.630
Is that team Dryad?

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:26.710
Yuji, this shady guy has been standing around out here...

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.420
What a creep!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.670
Something's fishy about this fella.

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:35.790
Sensory Share

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:35.670
He has a magic stone.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:38.630
That's probably where these monsters came from.

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:37.790
Spell-Transfer

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:38.790
Spell-Transfer

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:40.290
Is anyone with him?

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:41.790
Doesn't look it.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.670
Can you get in close?

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:47.250
I can get them down there.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.750
But that stone can kill with a single touch, so be careful.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.960
Are you trying to sacrifice us to stop this thing?!

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:53.920
What?!

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.250
You wouldn't!

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:58.830
I'm going to put a barrier on the stone
and then hit it with a dispel.

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:56.580
Spell-Transfer

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:57.250
Spell-Transfer

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:58.580
Spell-Transfer

00:09:58.830 --> 00:09:59.630
You'll be fine.

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:03.750
Spell-Transfer

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:01.250
Promise?

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:03.670
Yeah...

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:05.330
Hey, now!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:06.790
I didn't like that pause!

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.920
Go on, hop in!

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.420
Here goes!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:32.540
Yipee!

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:33.790
Get 'em!

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.830
Spell-Transfer! Magical Net!

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:40.630
Spell-Transferring Barrier!

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:42.750
Dispel Curse - Extreme!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.250
Magic...?

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:52.580
The dispel worked.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:55.040
Slime, bring him...

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:55.920
Wait!

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.580
Something's not right about him!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.170
Cleanse this tainted world!

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:11.500
He took his own life?

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.000
Yuji!

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:17.750
We're almost back!

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:20.500
That was fast!

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:23.580
Yahoo! Let's kick up some dust!

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:27.170
Hey, take a look!

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.130
Don't let up!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.420
There's no end to them!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:37.830
We're as good as done for!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.170
Proud Wolf, can you lend a paw?

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:46.750
Bwha?! Me?!

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.420
I-I, uhh...

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:52.040
Slimes, I want some of you to head and help Gale's team.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:53.460
Roger!

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:54.880
You got it!

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:57.040
If you say so.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.790
Spell-Transfer!

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:19.170
Fireball!

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:27.960
Fire-breathing slimes?!

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:33.750
Yuji has us covered! Now let's hold down this gate!

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:35.210
Yeah!

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:40.210
Simulation

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:38.000
They're more spread out than I thought.

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:40.170
Even if I put a barrier over the whole town,

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:43.250
Hellfire of Demise would still swallow the place whole.

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:50.250
That's it.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:53.080
If I transfer the spell to the barrier itself,

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.750
Magic Resistance Buff

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:55.750
Physical Buff

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:55.540
and then unleash the spell facing outwards...

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.750
Save Magic

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:55.750
Fire Magic

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.330
That's incredible...

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.130
Lily.

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:07.540
Tell Aegis to call Gale and the others back in town.

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:09.500
R-right!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.920
All slimes in the woods, return to town.

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:20.460
Spread out at equal intervals around the town.

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:22.290
Sure thing!

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:25.750
Team Dryad, head underground.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.040
Here we go!

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:28.080
Coming!

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:30.170
All together now.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:33.000
Mhm, should be safe in here.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.000
Everyone, fall back! Get inside the walls!

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.380
Slimes, are we ready?

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:56.330
Ready and waiting!

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:59.420
Just say the word!

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.630
Yuji, we have a problem!

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:19.000
Let's push this thing back!

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:37.790
Fall back! Our time is up!

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.500
Forget about us!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.580
Just do it, Yuji!

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:45.750
Slimes, can you handle this?

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:49.920
Huh?!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.210
Nicely done, Proud Wolf.

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:12.500
Spell-Transferring Barrier!

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:18.380
He put a barrier around the entire town?!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.710
Burn all to ash!

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:25.500
Hellfire of Demise!

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:38.210
All this from a tamer...?

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:41.460
Can one dragon bone truly unleash such firepower?

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.330
I've never even seen magic this strong!

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.790
Is this really his work?

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:50.420
Of course it is. Who else could it be?

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:55.000
Anyone who tried using magic like this
would destroy themselves!

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:56.830
It would be suicide!

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:58.580
What?!

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.170
That wasn't all of them, Yuji!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:29.920
Yuji!

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:38.080
Yuji

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:38.080
Class: Tamer, Sage

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:38.080
Skills: Taming, Sense Share, Holy Magic, Dark Magic, Fire Magic, Water Magic, Ice Magic,

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:38.080
Earth Magic, Lightning Magic, Wind Magic, Support Magic, Buff Magic,

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:38.080
Spell Transfer, Master-class Combat Skills, Magic Maker

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:38.080
Type: None

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:38.000
Guess I had to spend some HP
to cover that MP overdraw.

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:41.210
It hurts a bit, but I can take it.

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:44.630
Slimes, get ready for another.

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:48.420
You can't! You won't last another go!

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:51.920
I'll be fine.

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:53.040
Slimes!

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.080
Ready!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.630
We got this!

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:58.130
Spell-Transferring Barrier!

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:00.960
Hellfire of Demise!

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:24.880
Yuji!

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:36.000
Yuji!

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:38.040
Yay! You're up!

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:39.960
Got enough sleep?

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:58.750
Aegis!

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:00.670
Look...

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:07.500
I don't believe it...

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.540
Let's gather it all up and head back.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.330
This is good.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.380
I'm glad you weren't hurt.

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:45.040
Gale and everyone in town are having a big celebration.

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:48.830
Everyone's talking about how you saved us all.

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:52.420
Are they, now?

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:55.290
We really can't thank you enough.

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:57.750
You saved this town you hardly even know.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:04.750
Can I ask you why, Yuji?

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:22.710
Be sure you rest up tonight.

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:29.130
This project is bad news...

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:32.420
Come on, how are we gonna finish this in time?

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:50.960
Pardon me, I just figured it might get cold tonight,

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:53.500
so I brought another...

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.960
Ahh, now there's a nice breeze.

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:03.790
Sure am hungry, though.

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:06.380
So, why did we sneak out like that?

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:08.960
I wanted to eat all that good food!

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:11.040
I don't want to cause a scene.

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:17.170
Then we leapt in, surrounded the guy,
and hit him with three spells!

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:19.920
And with that the cursed stone was a threat no more.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.000
Wow, that's so cool!

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:24.880
The guy stopped moving, though.

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:28.250
Indeed, and so the mystery continues.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:40.710
"And so our hero left, without fame or fanfare."

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:48.670
A man we found dead in the woods was carrying this.

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:51.540
There was a dispelled stone nearby, too.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:53.460
This is...

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:58.710
It has to be the cult we've been hearing about.

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:01.460
I've already sent a report to central.

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:09.630
Yuji! We're almost there!

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:34.790
EPISODE 1

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:34.790
I WANTED TO PROTECT THE TOWN

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:09.830
Maa ikkatte ukenagashite
Brushing things off with a "whatever"

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:12.750
Nochi no jinsei wa henka shinakute
Stuck later in an unchanging life

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:15.130
Mou ikka wa joushuu no te de
The whatevers became habit

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:18.330
Boku no nouryoku wa imada sakanai
My skills still have yet to bloom

00:22:18.330 --> 00:22:23.290
Katou tomosezu makeru koto mo itowanai nara
If I don't try to win and but am unwilling to lose

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:29.040
Mukishitsu na shinjou wa naze toki o utsu
Why does this cold heart still beat with time?

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:35.210
Bokura dare mo ga himetaru chikara o motta monster
All of us are monsters with hidden powers

00:22:35.210 --> 00:22:41.080
Da toshite mezame saseru koto naku ikitekuno
Are we going to live without awakening them?

00:22:41.500 --> 00:22:44.330
Oshikonde futa shite
We push things down and cover them up

00:22:44.330 --> 00:22:46.960
Mou shinsen na kokoro janai
And our hearts are fresh no more

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:51.710
Sore demo kaoiro hitotsu kaezu ni ikiru monster
But we're monsters who continue on without so much as a face

00:22:52.880 --> 00:22:58.330
Dare mo ga mujikaku no sokojikara o uchi ni shinobaseru
